      "scope": "Candidate publication, not current source and not a native admission. The acquirer release-stores holder and ticket on a word the spin does not read, and only after its reserved ticket equals current. A consumer accepts that pair only when the published ticket still equals current. The participant release-stores the copied round and op after the flag reset; the next payload waits for the upward send. A stack word, a sticky owner read that ignores current, a split read of the completed pair, a recurring flag sample, and a joint report treated as one actor are negative controls. Cohort overwrite before copy is the negative completed-record control. Fault preservation of the new stores is not represented. The ABA mixed-field trace and the stack-word counterexample remain separate models."
